('wikiloc', '148136282', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/balerdi-148136282', 'BALERDI / MALLOZARRA (1183M) ARTUBI (1263M) ARAITZ-NAFARROA', '{"en":"Araitz valley loop with Artubi","ca":"Circular per la vall d''Araitz amb Artubi","es":"Circular por el valle de Araitz con Artubi"}'::jsonb, 'BALERDI /MALLOZARRA (1183M) ARTUBI (1263M) ARAITZ-NAFARROA Hiking trail in Altunegia, País Vasco (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Nafarroa eta Gipuzkoa artean kokatua dagoen mendi zoragarri hau Aralar mendikateko gailurrik esanguratsuenetako bat da. Iparraldetik begiratuta, Araitz bailaratik, kare harriz osatutako horma ikusgarri batzuk ditu. Behin goikaldera iritxitakoan, Artubi gailurra eta Balerdi gailurraren artean kresterio moduko bat igaro behar da, non tramo aereo horretan kontu haundiz ibili behar den eguraldi euritsu edo haizetsua izaten den egunetan. Amezketatik abiatzean, Arritzaga erreka jarraituz Anduitz bordara iristen zera eta ondoren minetako refugiora iristeko. https://euskalherriamendizmendi.blogspot.com/2023/12/balerdi-mallozarra-1193m-artubi-1263m.html', '{"en":"This loop route ascends Balerdi/Mallozarra (1183m) and Artubi (1263m) from Amezketa. Starting point is in the Araitz valley, offering impressive limestone walls on the north face. The trail follows the Arritzaga stream to Anduitz borda and then to the old mine refuge.\n\nOnce higher up, the route involves a ridge traverse between Artubi and Balerdi summits. This section is airy and requires significant caution, especially on rainy or windy days. The route covers 10.5 km with 993m of elevation gain.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular ascendeix a Balerdi/Mallozarra (1183m) i Artubi (1263m) des d''Amezketa. El punt de partida és a la vall d''Araitz, oferint impressionants parets de pedra calcària a la cara nord. El sender segueix el riu Arritzaga fins a Anduitz borda i després fins al refugi de les antigues mines.\n\nUn cop a dalt, la ruta implica una travessa de cresta entre els cims d''Artubi i Balerdi. Aquesta secció és aèria i requereix molta precaució, especialment en dies de pluja o vent. La ruta té 10.5 km amb 993m de desnivell positiu.","es":"Esta ruta circular asciende a Balerdi/Mallozarra (1183m) y Artubi (1263m) desde Amezketa. El punto de partida es en el valle de Araitz, ofreciendo impresionantes paredes de piedra caliza en la cara norte. El sendero sigue el arroyo Arritzaga hasta Anduitz borda y luego al refugio de las antiguas minas.\n\nUna vez en la parte superior, la ruta implica una travesía de cresta entre las cumbres de Artubi y Balerdi. Esta sección es aérea y requiere mucha precaución, especialmente en días de lluvia o viento. La ruta tiene 10.5 km con 993m de desnivel positivo."}'::jsonb, 'Asier Aldalur', 10461, 993, 993, 1263, 403, 'moderate', 'loop', 13680, 18900, 1919, '2023-09-23', '2023-08', '[{"lat":43.038772,"lng":-2.070248,"ele":422.2},{"lat":43.038719,"lng":-2.070257,"ele":422.2},{"lat":43.038672,"lng":-2.070277,"ele":422.4},{"lat":43.038623,"lng":-2.070286,"ele":421.9},{"lat":43.038566,"lng":-2.07028,"ele":422.4},{"lat":43.038516,"lng":-2.070243,"ele":422.8},{"lat":43.038486,"lng":-2.070189,"ele":423.8},{"lat":43.038475,"lng":-2.070116,"ele":424.3},{"lat":43.038475,"lng":-2.07005,"ele":424.5},{"lat":43.038447,"lng":-2.070001,"ele":424.5},{"lat":43.038418,"lng":-2.06994,"ele":424.2},{"lat":43.038417,"lng":-2.069861,"ele":421},{"lat":43.038397,"lng":-2.06979,"ele":419.7},{"lat":43.038378,"lng":-2.069729,"ele":417.9},{"lat":43.03834,"lng":-2.069689,"ele":416.8},{"lat":43.038316,"lng":-2.069614,"ele":416.5},{"lat":43.038293,"lng":-2.069559,"ele":416.5},{"lat":43.038242,"lng":-2.069515,"ele":416.6},{"lat":43.038196,"lng":-2.069483,"ele":416.9},{"lat":43.03816,"lng":-2.069415,"ele":417.4},{"lat":43.038121,"lng":-2.069373,"ele":417.6},{"lat":43.038071,"lng":-2.06936,"ele":418},{"lat":43.03802,"lng":-2.069348,"ele":418.6},{"lat":43.037968,"lng":-2.06932,"ele":419.6},{"lat":43.037919,"lng":-2.069271,"ele":422