*Desfiladero del río Purón y cimas de la Sierra de Artzena: Revillallanos, Valdelamediana y Santa Ana', '{"en":"This moderate 10.4 km loop with 793 m of elevation gain explores the eastern Sierra de Artzena, bordering Burgos. Starting from Bachicabo, the route ascends to five peaks: Bachicabo, Canto Pero, Peña del Mazo, Cruz de la Mosquera, and Los Castros (Peña Ana).\n\nThe trail generally follows clear paths, though some sections pass through dense boxwood. The ascent to Peña Ana is the most challenging part, with no clear path and requiring some route-finding, which can add significant time. The higher elevations offer sharp rocky crests and spectacular panoramic views.\n\nThis route is suitable for hikers comfortable with some off-trail navigation and dense vegetation.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular moderada de 10,4 km amb 793 m de desnivell explora la serra d''Artzena oriental, fent frontera amb Burgos. Sortint de Bachicabo, l''itinerari puja a cinc cims: Bachicabo, Canto Pero, Peña del Mazo, Cruz de la Mosquera i Los Castros (Peña Ana).\n\nEl camí segueix generalment sendes clares, tot i que alguns trams travessen densos boixos. L''ascens a Peña Ana és la part més exigent, sense un camí definit i requerint certa orientació, cosa que pot allargar el temps. Les cotes més altes ofereixen crestes rocoses esmolades i vistes panoràmiques espectaculars.\n\nAquesta ruta és adequada per a excursionistes acostumats a certa navegació fora de senders i vegetació densa.","es":"Esta ruta circular moderada de 10,4 km con 793 m de desnivel explora la Sierra de Artzena oriental, en la frontera con Burgos. Partiendo de Bachicabo, el itinerario asciende a cinco cimas: Bachicabo, Canto Pero, Peña del Mazo, Cruz de la Mosquera y Los Castros (Peña Ana).\n\nEl sendero generalmente sigue caminos claros, aunque algunos tramos atraviesan densos bojedales. El ascenso a Peña Ana es la parte más exigente, sin senda definida y requiriendo cierta orientación, lo que puede añadir tiempo. Las cotas más altas ofrecen afiladas crestas rocosas y espectaculares vistas panorámicas.\n\nEsta ruta es adecuada para excursionistas cómodos con cierta navegación fuera de sendero y vegetación densa."}'::jsonb, 'adrian_1985', 10396, 793, 793, 1190, 640, 'moderate', 'loop', NULL, 18360, 1706, '2016-11-27', '2016-10', '[{"lat":42.78955,"lng":-3.071404,"ele":649.1},{"lat":42.789582,"lng":-3.071473,"ele":649.8},{"lat":42.789563,"lng":-3.071398,"ele":649.1},{"lat":42.789587,"lng":-3.071423,"ele":649.3},{"lat":42.789548,"lng":-3.071463,"ele":649.6},{"lat":42.789503,"lng":-3.071397,"ele":649.1},{"lat":42.789455,"lng":-3.071395,"ele":649},{"lat":42.7894,"lng":-3.071374,"ele":648.8},{"lat":42.789343,"lng":-3.071398,"ele":648.7},{"lat":42.78929,"lng":-3.0714,"ele":648.5},{"lat":42.789233,"lng":-3.071418,"ele":648.3},{"lat":42.789186,"lng":-3.071464,"ele":648.1},{"lat":42.789128,"lng":-3.071486,"ele":647.7},{"lat":42.789073,"lng":-3.071546,"ele":647.1},{"lat":42.789042,"lng":-3.071605,"ele":646.8},{"lat":42.789013,"lng":-3.071655,"ele":646.4},{"lat":42.788949,"lng":-3.071718,"ele":646.2},{"lat":42.788903,"lng":-3.071774,"ele":646.3},{"lat":42.788856,"lng":-3.071798,"ele":646},{"lat":42.788812,"lng":-3.071829,"ele":645.8},{"lat":42.788768,"lng":-3.071866,"ele":645.5},{"lat":42.788717,"lng":-3.071904,"ele":645.2},{"lat":42.788665,"lng":-3.071935,"ele":644.7},{"lat":42.788614,"lng":-3.071966,"ele":644.6},{"lat":42.788545,"lng":-3.072012,"ele":644.7},{"lat":42.788504,"lng":-3.072052,"ele":645},{"lat":42.788435,"lng":-3.072103,"ele":645.1},{"lat":42.788384,"lng":-3.072159,"ele":645.5},{"lat":42.788337,"lng":-3.072186,"ele":645.3},{"lat":42.788291,"lng":-3.072277,"ele":646.9},{"lat":42.788262,"lng":-3.072334,"ele":648},{"lat":42.788226,"lng":-3.072374,"ele":648.4},{"lat":42.788177,"lng":-3.072446,"ele":649.3},{"lat":42.788151,"lng":-3.072497,"ele":650},{"lat":42.788128,"lng":-3.072537,"ele":650.4},{"lat":42.788087,"lng":-3.072594,"ele":650.7},{"lat":42.788061,"lng":-3.072639,"ele":651.