-Ruta Circular a Lokiz o San Cosme por el Barranco de la Poza desde la Estación de Bombeo de Itxako', '{"en":"This moderate 17.4 km loop in the Lokiz mountain range starts from Ganuza, ascending through the Zologorri ravine to Ganuza Pass. The trail then continues along the ravine before diverting to the summits of Sartzaleta Inferior and Sartzaleta, following paths parallel to the sierra''s cliffs.\n\nThe route passes through Aramendia Pass and Muneta Pass, from where it ascends the southern slope to the summit of Lokiz (San Cosme). The descent returns to Muneta Pass, following a track that skirts the southwestern slope back to Ganuza, completing the circuit. Expect varied terrain with both tracks and narrower paths.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular moderada de 17,4 km a la serra de Lokiz comença a Ganuza, ascendint pel barranc Zologorri fins al Port de Ganuza. El sender continua pel barranc abans de desviar-se cap als cims de Sartzaleta Inferior i Sartzaleta, seguint camins paral·lels als cingles de la serra.\n\nLa ruta passa pel Port d''Aramendia i el Port de Muneta, des d''on s''ascendeix per la vessant sud fins al cim de Lokiz (San Cosme). El descens retorna al Port de Muneta, seguint una pista que voreja la vessant sud-oest de tornada a Ganuza, completant el circuit. Espereu un terreny variat amb pistes i senders més estrets.","es":"Esta ruta circular moderada de 17,4 km en la sierra de Lokiz comienza en Ganuza, ascendiendo por el barranco Zologorri hasta el Puerto de Ganuza. El sendero continúa por el barranco antes de desviarse hacia las cimas de Sartzaleta Inferior y Sartzaleta, siguiendo caminos paralelos a los cortados de la sierra.\n\nLa ruta pasa por el Puerto de Aramendia y el Puerto de Muneta, desde donde se asciende por la vertiente sur hasta la cima de Lokiz (San Cosme). El descenso retorna al Puerto de Muneta, siguiendo una pista que faldea la vertiente suroeste de vuelta a Ganuza, completando el circuito. Espere un terreno variado con pistas y senderos más estrechos."}'::jsonb, 'balasitxo', 17381, 718, 718, 1109, 585, 'moderate', 'loop', NULL, 27540, 3317, '2016-12-03', '2016-11', '[{"lat":42.69782,"lng":-2.133883,"ele":592},{"lat":42.697818,"lng":-2.133882,"ele":592},{"lat":42.697818,"lng":-2.133881,"ele":591.9},{"lat":42.697815,"lng":-2.133885,"ele":592},{"lat":42.697812,"lng":-2.133888,"ele":592},{"lat":42.697802,"lng":-2.133895,"ele":592.1},{"lat":42.697804,"lng":-2.133893,"ele":592},{"lat":42.69781,"lng":-2.133892,"ele":592},{"lat":42.697826,"lng":-2.133892,"ele":592},{"lat":42.69783,"lng":-2.133893,"ele":592},{"lat":42.697828,"lng":-2.133892,"ele":592},{"lat":42.697818,"lng":-2.133888,"ele":592},{"lat":42.697817,"lng":-2.13389,"ele":592},{"lat":42.69782,"lng":-2.1339,"ele":592.1},{"lat":42.697812,"lng":-2.133894,"ele":592.1},{"lat":42.697817,"lng":-2.133891,"ele":592},{"lat":42.697818,"lng":-2.133892,"ele":592},{"lat":42.697815,"lng":-2.133894,"ele":592.1},{"lat":42.697819,"lng":-2.133897,"ele":592.1},{"lat":42.697821,"lng":-2.133894,"ele":592.1},{"lat":42.697833,"lng":-2.133894,"ele":592.1},{"lat":42.697843,"lng":-2.1339,"ele":592.1},{"lat":42.697898,"lng":-2.133938,"ele":592.5},{"lat":42.697989,"lng":-2.133967,"ele":592.6},{"lat":42.698015,"lng":-2.133978,"ele":592.7},{"lat":42.698096,"lng":-2.134004,"ele":592.8},{"lat":42.698113,"lng":-2.134011,"ele":592.8},{"lat":42.698121,"lng":-2.13402,"ele":592.8},{"lat":42.698123,"lng":-2.13402,"ele":592.8},{"lat":42.69814,"lng":-2.134041,"ele":592.9},{"lat":42.698132,"lng":-2.134025,"ele":592.8},{"lat":42.698139,"lng":-2.134024,"ele":592.8},{"lat":42.69814,"lng":-2.134027,"ele":592.8},{"lat":42.698164,"lng":-2.134043,"ele":592.9},{"lat":42.698169,"lng":-2.134046,"ele":592.9},{"lat":42.698171,"lng":-2.13406,"ele":593},{"lat":42.698168,"lng":-2.134061,"ele":593},{"lat":42.698169,"lng":-2.134062,"ele":593},{"lat":42.698233,"lng":-2.134065,"ele":592.9},{"lat":42.698258,"lng":-2.134069,"ele":592.8},{"lat":42.698336,"lng":-2.134081,"ele":592.7},{"lat":42.698426,"lng":-2